      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1742733581847,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "in image to image, we have a small change. instead of passing\nrandom noise, we pass the image through the encoder network.\nwe add noise in the latent space - more the noise, more the\nflexibility for the model to change it along with the prompt\nembeddings. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "in image to image, we have a small change. instead of passing random noise, we pass the image through the encoder network. we add noise in the latent space - more the noise, more the flexibility for the model to change it along with the prompt embeddings. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
